<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Hello everyone, I hope you are all doing well,<o:p><=
/o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">March is right around the corner, so here are the da=
tes and times for the Orientations that we have planned for March 2025.&nbs=
p; First off, we try to have our new arriving Hosts arrive at the State Par=
k on the final day of the current month
 to get settled in and set up for the big day of Orientations that we hold =
on the 1<sup>st</sup> of the new month.&nbsp; For this month, please try to=
 arrive on the 28<sup>th</sup> of February to your designated campsite as w=
e will be jumping into trainings in the
 morning of the 1<sup>st</sup>.&nbsp; If you are unsure of what site you ar=
e headed to, please contact me .&nbsp; We try to hold most of the orientati=
ons on the 1<sup>st</sup> of the new month so that everyone is all trained =
up and ready to start their shifts, as some
 of you will have a shift that starts on the 1<sup>st</sup> of March.&nbsp;=
 <o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">If anyone still needs to complete the required train=
ings on the Volunteer Voice Website, I have placed a link below.&nbsp; The =
required trainings are the following: The Park Host Safety Training, The DA=
S Discrimination and Harassment Training,
 and the Volunteer Service Agreement. These trainings must be completed ann=
ually, so if you have not done them yet for 2025 then please do. &nbsp;<o:p=
></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><a href=3D"https://sites.google.com/view/oprdvolunte=
ervoice/forms-requirements-resources">OPRD Volunteer Voice - Forms, Require=
ments, Resources</a><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The <b>Welcome Center Operations Orientation</b> wil=
l be held on December 1st at 10am @ the Welcome Center.&nbsp;
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The <b>Yurt &amp; Site Maintenance Orientation</b> w=
ill be on December 1st at 11am @ the A loop Restroom/Pipe Chase.
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The <b>All-Host General Orientation</b> will be at 1=
pm on March 3rd @ the Welcome Center.&nbsp; For the All-Host General Orient=
ation we ask that all of our current and new hosts attend so that we can al=
l introduce ourselves to one another and
 also meet the Ranger Staff here at Honeyman State Park as well as talk abo=
ut upcoming events or trainings that Park Staff will be attending. &nbsp;If=
 you have your own chair, please bring it as we tend to run out in the welc=
ome center.&nbsp; Once the meet and greet
 portion is over, only our new arrivals for March will need to attend the r=
est of the Orientation. &nbsp;I will also be giving out gloves, hats, and v=
ests if you are in need of those once the presentation is over.
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I have also attached a copy of the March Schedule fo=
r your viewing pleasure.
<o:p></o:p></p>
